| `Source/WjWorld/GamePlay/Placement/WjWorldPlacementCameraPawn.h` | **NEW** | Camera pawn class declaration |
| `Source/WjWorld/GamePlay/Placement/WjWorldPlacementCameraPawn.cpp` | **NEW** | Camera pawn implementation |
| `Source/WjWorld/Setting/WjWorldDeveloperSettings.h` | **MODIFY** | Add 4 camera InputAction soft refs + speed setting |
| `Source/WjWorld/Core/Local/Lobby/WjWorldPlayerControllerLobby.h` | **MODIFY** | Add SwitchToPlacementCamera(), RestoreOriginalPawn(), OriginalPawn, PlacementCameraPawn |
| `Source/WjWorld/Core/Local/Lobby/WjWorldPlayerControllerLobby.cpp` | **MODIFY** | Implement SwitchToPlacementCamera(), RestoreOriginalPawn() |
| `Source/WjWorld/Core/Local/Lobby/WjWorldGameModeLobby.h` | **MODIFY** | Add HandlePlacementModeChanged() UFUNCTION, forward declare camera pawn |
